Description: Partners page for System Settings
 Who answers each kind of work (text, speech, image, 3D) on this computer or
 at a provider, with which model and on which card: the local engines
 (Ollama, installed with the runner for this computer's card, and
 llama.cpp), turned on and off, Ollama's models downloaded with their size
 shown first and held on a metered connection; signing in to Ollama's
 service; providers with their keys in KDE Wallet; and each program's own
 choice beside the system default. Its command, sparky-stereo-partners,
 answers programs and tests the same way.
